<title>FINLAND: SKOP COMPLETES VIRGIN ISLAND HOTEL SALE.</title>
<headline>SKOP COMPLETES VIRGIN ISLAND HOTEL SALE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank Yrityspankki Skop Oy said on Friday it had finalised a deal to sell a hotel and related real estate in the Virgin Islands and a shopping centre in the U.S. for a total of $87 million or 444 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The total sum of the deals is about $87 million or about 444 million markka,&quot; Skop said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
